  "body": "A rare coastal offering where contemporary luxury meets breath taking views.\r\nPrivately positioned just moments from the golden sands of Takapuna Beach, this near-new residence delivers an exceptional calibre of modern living, defined by architectural sophistication, generous proportions and an extraordinary coastal outlook.\r\n\r\nSet on an approximately 561sqm freehold site, the home has been thoughtfully oriented to capture its spectacular natural surroundings. From the main living spaces and master suite, panoramic views sweep across the sea to Rangitoto and the Hauraki Gulf, creating an ever-changing backdrop from sunrise to sunset.\r\n\r\nDesigned with both elegance and everyday living in mind, the residence showcases high-stud ceilings, premium finishes, expansive glazing and an abundance of natural light. The result is a home that feels sophisticated and impressive, yet warm and effortlessly comfortable.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan kitchen, dining and living domain forms the centrepiece of the home, embracing the views while opening naturally to the outdoor entertaining areas. The beautifully appointed kitchen features premium appliances, a generous island and a walk-in scullery, providing the perfect setting for everything from relaxed family meals to sophisticated entertaining.\r\n\r\nAccommodation is equally impressive, with four bedrooms and four bathrooms, including an exceptional master suite that takes full advantage of the coastal outlook. A walk-in wardrobe, luxurious ensuite and private balcony complete this tranquil retreat, with uninterrupted panoramic views towards Rangitoto and the Hauraki Gulf.\r\nMultiple living zones provide an enviable level of flexibility. In addition to the main living area, two separate sitting rooms and a substantial ground-floor lounge create spaces for family gatherings, quiet relaxation or entertaining on a grander scale.\r\n\r\nFor the discerning golf enthusiast, the ground-floor lounge offers an exciting opportunity to create a dedicated golf simulator room, with the impressive stud height providing an ideal foundation.\r\n\r\nOutside, the landscaped grounds are designed for effortless enjoyment, with covered entertaining areas, generous off-street parking and a private putting green adding to the home's lifestyle appeal.\r\n\r\nFurther features include ducted air conditioning, a gas fireplace, excellent storage and a generous double internal-access garage, ensuring every aspect of modern living has been carefully considered.\r\n\r\nThis is more than a near-new home. It is a statement of coastal living at its finest — a private sanctuary combining architectural quality, panoramic views, exceptional flexibility and one of Auckland's most coveted beachside locations.\r\n\r\nMoments from Takapuna Beach. Minutes from everything. A world away from ordinary.",
